# Blightmire (CIPlay blightmire): the hummock round 0 -32, the roots west -30 0, north 8 22, east 34 -6 (burnt in that
# order: the east one first is refused), the marsh station 12 26, the root cache by the east root.
island Blightmire
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Poisoned Marsh
zone hummock
expect step 1
read Blight map
expect step 2
open Smelter camp chest
wait 3
expect step 3
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0
expect step 4
use root3
expect story burnt 0
use root1
expect story burnt 1
expect hidden root1
expect shown fire1
expect step 5
use root2
expect story burnt 2
expect step 6
open Marsh station locker
wait 3
expect step 7
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 8
use root3
expect story burnt 3
expect shown rootcache
expect step 9
open Root cache
wait 3
expect step 10
read Seedkeeper's confession
expect done
